              <lg xml:id="m-29fa4a05-f1ad-48e5-9db6-30680f2faa83">
                <l xml:id="m-f2fa7c71-f1a6-47a9-97d4-5eee26239ce9" facs="#m-73de8fc7-a81a-46b0-9078-ad2c7190ad07" label="ambiguous">eo3</l><l xml:id="m-11d02674-74f8-41fe-b114-280cabd34f57" facs="#m-71cc3556-7372-4260-80ec-1242c9aaed90" label="text-like">At Mass</l><l xml:id="m-ab2c56ba-dfd8-485e-8636-797e6c8aabf9" facs="#m-ca84b444-beda-4b63-bcdf-1575a026836b" label="lyrics-like">ni : et dedé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c388c1c4-2897-4ef6-8b2d-0885697855b0" facs="#m-e9baa62e-3ecc-4495-a7a3-3d7ab858166d" label="lyrics-like">in é-scam mé¬ am</l><l xml:id="m-6249d063-b3ca-4f5c-b4ee-eaf39d9dfa54" facs="#m-fd25a57a-53e4-4af4-adf4-efff03705592" label="lyrics-like">vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-21796cca-643b-442c-94d0-90dbc055cafa" facs="#m-966e47be-f4ad-44c0-9a28-169aa5800b29" label="ambiguous">runt</l><l xml:id="m-f9e14460-0e29-41a5-be71-081f708a4dc3" facs="#m-9d1d76c0-f7d5-4666-bc15-cead45830654" label="ambiguous">fel,</l><l xml:id="m-58f7062f-8819-448e-a8bb-415883ded808" facs="#m-51e81f74-d9a9-4769-885e-010a1cd9aa0f" label="lyrics-like">et in sí-ti mé¬ a po-ta- vé- runt me</l><l xml:id="m-cec45d67-f64d-4140-9a2f-7ab45315094e" facs="#m-b795c6fe-e310-443a-bfd7-f4ecd3338891" label="lyrics-like">a-cé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a819dbda-4451-41da-831f-e40b87af8eda" facs="#m-67368c66-ae71-4756-92aa-7fdec54f23de" label="ambiguous">to.</l><l xml:id="m-26edb580-9ddb-409c-b665-1cba54943883" facs="#m-8b483b9d-a7c9-48cf-9242-e157b63ba139" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-f56f388f-db0a-476b-b6ad-ee5286f65889" facs="#m-ec7e3ba2-d5a4-4766-a71e-c8f2ac6d1fb4" label="lyrics-like">vOncéde, quaésumus, Dómine: devotiónis obtineat, et efféctum</l><l xml:id="m-8111dae7-0f7d-4fea-af49-dbedb6fe1f3a" facs="#m-3fb3ea3c-8f7f-48bf-bd84-bea1cade11da" label="lyrics-like">beátae perennitátis acquirat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-baeda7c9-9761-47e4-a349-e154370696bd" facs="#m-c6bad6a4-7edd-4692-a799-bb3f47d4d13f" label="lyrics-like">Cut óculis tuae majestátis mu¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fb28c70-b6bf-4269-9546-a06e1c0494e9" facs="#m-ad260a52-5715-4c2c-ae31-10362c2c05c2" label="lyrics-like">nus oblátum, et grátiam nobis! Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-634ec2c9-2a03-453e-928e-0cf635caddaa" facs="#m-f6cceeca-0ee8-48a1-a64d-c77517e416d9" label="text-like">Preface of the holy Cross</l><l xml:id="m-40455578-37ef-4464-aeae-7e65cb5bc3b7" facs="#m-0c5a46e6-8237-4a2f-bb15-de8d37a81fbf" label="lyrics-like">(JEre dignum et justum est, aequum et salutáre, nos tibi semper</l><l xml:id="m-748ddbbc-1d3f-4b42-8f24-2fd97f4c960e" facs="#m-6f246d86-5037-4869-915a-5bc8e0e48a29" label="lyrics-like">Y et ubique grátias ágere: Dómine, sancte Pater, ommipotens</l><l xml:id="m-4a6ec50a-c4ac-4993-bba2-72877a5e154a" facs="#m-678fe70f-35f4-4945-8b4a-ad9e2c477908" label="lyrics-like">aetérne Deus:</l><l xml:id="m-c3b41ea4-e171-4d89-9ebc-94d93db04b38" facs="#m-6f16e725-b42c-45b7-89d1-be1c93d83f43" label="lyrics-like">Qui salútem humáni géneris in ligno Crucis constituisti: ut,</l><l xml:id="m-af342e56-5415-4c25-931a-d9a7d58561af" facs="#m-48fe6cef-04cb-467e-91fd-4ad16096d1c3" label="lyrics-like">unde mors oriebátur, inde vita resúrgeret : et, qui in ligno vincé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b94b82a9-b7f0-45e2-a820-224599f20c11" facs="#m-d66aa1b0-1c82-4e41-8d00-d9144b4b3557" label="lyrics-like">bat, in ligno quoque vincerétur : per Christum Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-18dd89ab-6851-469c-84b9-79d75edbcfe7" facs="#m-47be0d4f-c1a5-4a78-9371-13308269473f" label="lyrics-like">Per quem majestátem tuam laudant Angeli, adórant Domina¬</l><l xml:id="m-093ff36a-264d-4411-b53b-b64ebbb7216e" facs="#m-fe7a94e5-185e-42b0-b3b9-9f084afbc8d3" label="lyrics-like">tiónes, tremunt Potestátes. Caeli, caelorúmque Virtútes, ac beáta</l><l xml:id="m-7c1d5ca2-6a91-4106-834d-365e39089ce7" facs="#m-928651a7-1bee-4181-8474-f8584e96e209" label="lyrics-like">Séraphim, socia exsultatióne concélebrant. Cum quibus et nostras</l><l xml:id="m-f3d3c145-e2e0-47d3-b8dc-351bb9cca43d" facs="#m-883a91eb-5f56-473b-9e3e-52a793f37104" label="lyrics-like">voces ut admitti júbeas, deprecámur, súpplici confessióne dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-2464044d-b2f7-4209-abfd-1698c9a6f734" facs="#m-a7085a13-7fdc-4946-8c84-399cd95e1754" label="lyrics-like">Sánctus, p. 61.</l><l xml:id="m-bcd85bd2-ccfd-476f-816d-a75fb0ce343f" facs="#m-d1770885-542a-4911-905d-1c405f26943f" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-c76c54c1-6dc5-45ba-b6b5-01cc84e4e80b" facs="#m-f2b4d8cc-6d21-443e-993e-a13ad20e2162" label="lyrics-like">A-ter, si non pótest hic cá¬lix transí-re, ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d442eaa-d227-433b-9780-707f276c3f31" facs="#m-204e81c1-9f63-43b5-b665-6bb9246817d5" label="lyrics-like">si bibam sl-lum: fi- at vo-lúntas tú¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-95cdf61d-a779-4d53-a921-8dd06a5aa83a" facs="#m-2a8ccfc3-74ce-4362-9870-734d6bc31dd3" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-129484aa-f566-4167-8a87-f42edae17ba6" facs="#m-eb7d3234-8a3d-4b84-afd3-dac552b334b4" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-298a4b95-81ff-43ba-bf10-08077d2fb805" facs="#m-46c8aaae-ec3b-48e4-925e-66cea8662ad8" label="lyrics-like">DER hujus, Dómine, operatió-] purgéntur, et justa desidéria</l><l xml:id="m-3813f6e3-3430-4447-8631-13473150f18e" facs="#m-1e81034c-c8f2-464b-9d03-fd87a8929c13" label="lyrics-like">nem mystérii : et vitia nostra ] compleántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7a16570e-8c8e-4200-adc3-78cd20254515" facs="#m-99ec2234-506c-42ac-813d-4a361205f754" label="text-like">At the end of Mass the celebrant gives the blessinɇ as usual but omits</l><l xml:id="m-6049d858-bd35-4345-94b8-9550183ce0b0" facs="#m-943462d3-f319-493f-93b5-1f2c03995438" label="text-like">the Last Gospel, and all return to the sacristy.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>